# The pinned Gateway binary builder uses the repository root because
# fluss-gateway has a path dependency on fluss-rust. The release image itself
# uses docker/fluss-gateway as its build context.
*
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!fluss-gateway/
!fluss-gateway/**
!fluss-rust/
!fluss-rust/**
!docker/
!docker/fluss-gateway/
!docker/fluss-gateway/**

# Generated and local-only files inside the included Rust workspaces.
fluss-gateway/target/
fluss-gateway/.idea/
fluss-gateway/.vscode/
fluss-rust/target/
fluss-rust/**/target/
fluss-rust/.idea/
fluss-rust/.vscode/

# Prepared image inputs belong to the release image build context, not to the
# binary builder that runs from the repository root.
docker/fluss-gateway/build-target/
